   "widgets_values": [
    "ELEMENT FORGE (Krea2)\n\n1. Pick a prompt from the bank (edit prompts/element_prompts.json to\n   add your own; the node rescans it). extra_style appends color/mood.\n2. Queue: Krea2 generates the element, Flare Texture Prepare pulls the\n   background to black, centers it and feathers the border, and Flare\n   Element Save files it under elements/<category>/<name>.png.\n3. Use it: in the Flare Lab editor, + add element > Texture, then pick\n   your file from the dropdown. Or wire a Flare Element Picker.\n4. Bump seed for variations; luminance mode makes tintable neutral\n   elements, rgb keeps the generated color."
   ],
   "color": "#432",
   "bgcolor": "#653"
  }
